# The fprisc-81 floorplan, which fprisc-72 shares
# (docs/2026-11-06-AREA-CENSUS-AND-FLOORPLAN.md and
# docs/2026-11-06-THREE-CLOCK-PORT.md): the slow path's registers leave the
# middle of the die, so the pipeline's memory-facing stages can sit beside
# the cache and its three-clock port places. Each region has about 1.5 times
# the slices its group's logic needs.
#
# Registers one LUT cone from the pipeline stay unplaced: moving them would
# stretch a pipeline path (cpuInterruptDue alone feeds 1,162 registers).
free    ^pipeline
csr     R[2:9]C[2:55]     ^machine: csr, trap, counters
bus     R[38:53]C[2:19]   ^machine: bus and devices
